      "message": "As we discussed, in the event that the TCPC auto-toggles to source and finds a sink attached, we\u0027re not state transitioning correctly.\n\nWe can probably simplify things by making the following assumptions:\n\n- We\u0027ll only enable TCPC low-power mode in S3 and S5.\n- When low-power mode is enabled, we don\u0027t care about source role at all.",
